# Molecule
.molecule/

# Runtime artifacts, written at the repository root by the playbooks. Anchored, all of
# them: an unanchored `plans/` matches a directory of that name at any depth, and there is
# one under test/fixtures/ holding a committed store -- so the fixture was silently left out
# of a commit with nothing saying so. The same mistake `tasks/` made in session 3.
/facts/
/observations/
/plans/
*.plan.json
*.verify.json

# Editors and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
